OL,3,GNEWSAHertfordshire could get elected
OL,4,Amayor, says Healey
OL,5,
OL,6,FHertfordshire could soon get a directly
OL,7,Felected mayor, it was announced in the
OL,8,FBudget.
OL,10,FChancellor John Healey said the
OL,11,Fgovernment was in the final stages of
OL,12,Fagreeing Mayoral Strategic Authorities
OL,13,Ffor Hertfordshire and other areas,
OL,14,Fincluding Kent, Leicestershire, Rutland
OL,15,Fand Devon.
OL,17,FThe mayor would make key decisions in
OL,18,Ftransport, housing, and infrastructure.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
